        "Masha'Allah, what a beautiful pixel art sprite!",
        "Time for Fajr prayer, pause the speedrun!",
        "When the Adhan plays, you stop the gaming session instantly.",
        "Halal check: Approved by the gaming council!",
        "Brother, lower your gaze... and fix the camera angle!",
        "Eating dates and drinking water before starting the speedrun.",
        "Insha'Allah we beat the final boss without dying once!",
        "Bismillah Al-Rahman Al-Rahim - Let's compile!",
